# Faramis, Soul Binder

> Faramis is a resurrection button wrapped in a mage kit. Every skill exists to get his team back into a fight they should have lost, and the player's only real job is casting Nether Realm at the exact moment the teamfight is about to collapse. Draft him when your team groups; bench him when they do not.

