- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when chain crowd control is the real threat and you can still reach cooldown cap through items.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when a dive assassin can kill Faramis before Nether Realm is cast.; Ice Queen Wand over Blood Wings when Use when your team needs repeated slows to keep marked targets inside follow-up damage.
